{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrol is a grand strategy game focused on capturing and holding strategic resources. The objective is simple: control all resources and destroy rival empires.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture Resources:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The empire that controls a resource receives a yield at the end of each round. These resources can be used to build and upgrade towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/extras/856244ddbd596ed09544b36e96b4692d.avif?t=1760613994\" alt=\"Capture Resources\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Upgrade Towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different towers require distinct resources to unlock. Each tower type has unique strengths and weaknesses, so spend your resources wisely to optimize your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/extras/b1f2bcd1bde3e1338a6afdd230e9b6ac.avif?t=1760613994\" alt=\"Different Tower Types\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Enemy Territory:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your towers and build more to expand your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865430/extras/a5249d15c29f58892cec301d0e3b33f5.avif?t=1760613994\" alt=\"Expand your Territory\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>German stuff...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Impressum:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Max Krupp</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><